{"id":"h-nb-001","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"सुशीला का बच्चा छठे दिन का है, वजन एक किलो नौ सौ, साँस बासठ एक मिनट में, दूध पी रहा है ठीक से।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Sushila","day":6,"weight_g":1900,"resp_rate":62,"feeding":"good"},"flags":["nb_fast_breathing","nb_low_weight"],"tags":["numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"h-nb-002","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"हाँ जी, बिंदु के बेटे को पीलिया है, हथेली भी पीली है, आठ दिन का है। बदन ठंडा नहीं है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Bindu","day":8,"symptoms":{"jaundice":true,"jaundice_palms_soles":true,"cold_to_touch":false}},"flags":["nb_jaundice_palms"],"tags":["filler","local-idiom","negation"]}
{"id":"h-nb-003","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"टेम्परेचर 96 डिग्री आया, बच्चा ठीक से दूध पी रहा, वजन पौने तीन किलो। हेमलता का बच्चा, तीसरा दिन।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Hemlata","day":3,"weight_g":2750,"temp_c":35.6,"feeding":"good"},"flags":["nb_hypothermia"],"tags":["fahrenheit","fraction-words","borderline","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"h-nb-004","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बच्चा ढीला पड़ा है, आँख नहीं खोल रहा, दूध भी नहीं पी रहा। चंदा की बच्ची, चौथे दिन की।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Chanda","day":4,"feeding":"none","symptoms":{"lethargy":true}},"flags":["nb_lethargy","nb_not_feeding","nb_sepsis_signs"],"tags":["local-idiom","multi-sign"]}
{"id":"h-nb-005","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"वजन ढाई किलो से थोड़ा कम है, दो किलो चार सौ अस्सी ग्राम। पल्लवी का बच्चा, सातवाँ दिन, नाभि साफ है, दूध अच्छा पी रहा।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Pallavi","day":7,"weight_g":2480,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"cord_pus":false}},"flags":["nb_low_weight"],"tags":["borderline","numbers-in-words","distractor-number","negation","watch-only"]}
{"id":"h-nb-006","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"निर्मला के बच्चे को झटके नहीं आए, बुखार भी नहीं, पर पसली चल रही है। दस दिन का है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Nirmala","day":10,"symptoms":{"convulsions":false,"hot_to_touch":false,"chest_indrawing":true}},"flags":["nb_chest_indrawing"],"tags":["negation","local-idiom"]}
{"id":"h-nb-007","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"तापमान सैंतीस पॉइंट चार है। काजल का बच्चा चौदह दिन का, वजन तीन किलो तीन सौ, सब ठीक।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Kajal","day":14,"weight_g":3300,"temp_c":37.4},"flags":[],"tags":["normal-visit","borderline","celsius","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"h-nb-008","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"इस घर में बच्चे की टट्टी में खून है और बार बार उल्टी कर रहा है। सत्रह दिन का है।","record":{"type":"newborn","day":17,"symptoms":{"blood_stool":true,"vomiting":true}},"flags":["nb_blood_stool","nb_vomiting"],"tags":["multi-sign","local-idiom","no-name"]}
{"id":"h-nb-009","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"बच्चे का वजन अठारह सौ ग्राम... नहीं, सत्रह सौ अस्सी ग्राम है। तारा का बच्चा, पाँचवाँ दिन, दूध कम पी रहा है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Tara","day":5,"weight_g":1780,"feeding":"poor"},"flags":["nb_poor_feeding","nb_very_low_weight"],"tags":["self-correction","borderline","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"h-nb-010","lang":"hi","script":"devanagari","said":"गुड़िया की बच्ची इक्कीस दिन की है, आँख से पानी और कीचड़ आ रहा, बदन भी गरम है, पर रोती ज़ोर से है।","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Gudiya","day":21,"symptoms":{"eye_discharge":true,"hot_to_touch":true,"weak_cry":false}},"flags":["nb_eye_discharge","nb_fever"],"tags":["local-idiom","negation","no-number-fever"]}
