{"id":"h-nb-012","lang":"hi","script":"roman","said":"accha didi, Saba ke bachche ki saans 60 hai, pasli nahi chal rahi, wazan 2 kilo 500 gram, 7 din","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Saba","day":7,"weight_g":2500,"resp_rate":60,"symptoms":{"chest_indrawing":false}},"flags":["nb_fast_breathing"],"tags":["borderline","negation","filler","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"h-nb-013","lang":"hi","script":"roman","said":"bachche ka badan thanda hai, temperature 35.4 aaya, rona bhi kamzor. Tanuja ka baby, teesra din","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Tanuja","day":3,"temp_c":35.4,"symptoms":{"cold_to_touch":true,"weak_cry":true}},"flags":["nb_hypothermia","nb_sepsis_signs","nb_weak_cry"],"tags":["celsius","multi-sign","borderline","numbers-digits"]}
{"id":"h-nb-014","lang":"hi","script":"roman","said":"Ishrat ka baby, aaj pehla din hai, aankhein peeli lag rahi hain, wazan dhai kilo","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Ishrat","day":1,"weight_g":2500,"symptoms":{"jaundice":true}},"flags":["nb_jaundice_early"],"tags":["borderline","fraction-words","local-idiom"]}
{"id":"h-nb-015","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"वृषालीचं बाळ तिसऱ्या दिवसाचं, वजन दीड किलो, दूध पीत नाही, अंग थंड लागतंय.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Vrushali","day":3,"weight_g":1500,"feeding":"none","symptoms":{"cold_to_touch":true}},"flags":["nb_hypothermia","nb_not_feeding","nb_sepsis_signs","nb_very_low_weight"],"tags":["fraction-words","multi-sign","local-idiom"]}
{"id":"h-nb-016","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"हो ताई, अस्मिताचं बाळ सातवा दिवस, श्वास एकसष्ट, छाती आत जात नाही, दूध नीट पितं.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Asmita","day":7,"resp_rate":61,"feeding":"good","symptoms":{"chest_indrawing":false}},"flags":["nb_fast_breathing"],"tags":["borderline","negation","filler","numbers-in-words"]}
{"id":"h-nb-017","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"शुभांगीला ताप आहे, पण बाळाचं तापमान नव्याण्णव डिग्री आहे, बाळाचं अंग गरम वाटत नाही, वजन दोन किलो सातशे.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Shubhangi","weight_g":2700,"temp_c":37.2,"symptoms":{"hot_to_touch":false}},"flags":[],"tags":["normal-visit","fahrenheit","numbers-in-words","negation","subject-ambiguity"]}
{"id":"h-nb-018","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"बाळाच्या नाळेतून पू आणि रक्त येतंय, आणि अंगावर पुरळ, फोड आलेत. सायलीचं बाळ, नववा दिवस.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Sayali","day":9,"symptoms":{"cord_pus":true,"skin_pustules":true}},"flags":["nb_cord_infection","nb_skin_pustules"],"tags":["multi-sign","local-idiom"]}
{"id":"h-nb-019","lang":"mr","script":"devanagari","said":"बाळाला झटके येतात, आणि तापमान अडतीस पॉइंट एक. भाग्यश्रीचं बाळ, बारावा दिवस.","record":{"type":"newborn","name":"Bhagyashree","day":12,"temp_c":38.1,"symptoms":{"convulsions":true}},"flags":["nb_convulsions","nb_fever"],"tags":["celsius","multi-sign","numbers-in-words"]}
